; Windows counterpart of exports.map.
;
; Detours puts this DLL into cs2.exe's import table by ordinal, and ordinal 1
; has to exist. NONAME keeps it out of the name table, so nothing can resolve
; it by name. The DLL exports nothing else: it is not looked up by anyone.
EXPORTS
    CstDetoursOrdinal1 @1 NONAME
